    "actions": [
      {
        "name": "Kiss",
        "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[Melee Attack, a Paralyzed Enemy | Will]: Dethbat's Curse (Continual, until removed)</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Dethbat's Curse [Curse]:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Every hour while cursed and not in Sunlight, the victim rolls a d6, progressing the curse by 1 stage on a roll of 1:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">1. Their hair falls out.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">2. Their ears transform into wings and their teeth become fangs.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">3. They gain 1 Fatigue. If they die due to this, their head rips from their body and becomes a Dethbat.</span></p>",
